  "panels": [
    {
      "title": "What this board is, and what it is not",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**This board evidences controls. It does not assess a maturity level.** Maturity Levels One to Three are an assessment against requirements Puppet cannot see, and nothing here should be read as a level.\n\nPuppet's evidence is of three kinds: **what is under management** (resource types Puppet is enforcing), **whether enforcement is holding** (corrective changes, where Puppet found drift and put it back), and **what a scanner measured** (CIS benchmark scores, where Comply or SCM is running).\n\n**An empty panel means Puppet does not evidence that control. It does not mean the control is unmet.** Several Essential Eight strategies are enforced by systems Puppet does not manage, and this board is silent about those by design rather than by omission.\n"
      },
      "id": 497422005
    },
    {
      "title": "Resource Types Enforced",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(puppet_resource_type_count{alias=~\"${pe}\",job=~\"${pdctng_job}\"}) or (vector(0) and on() (count(puppet_exporter_collector_success{collector=\"resource_types\",alias=~\"${pe}\",job=~\"${pdctng_job}\"}) > 0))",
          "legendFormat": "types",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "#8e949f",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "Not collected"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "description": "Distinct Puppet resource types being enforced across the fleet. The breadth of what is under configuration control, whatever it is called locally.",
      "id": 1024563376
    },
    {
      "title": "Drift Corrected (7d)",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(puppet_changes_total{kind=\"corrective\",alias=~\"${pe}\",job=~\"${pdctng_job}\"}[7d])) or (vector(0) and on() (count(puppet_exporter_collector_success{collector=\"change_types\",alias=~\"${pe}\",job=~\"${pdctng_job}\"}) > 0))",
          "legendFormat": "corrective",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "#8e949f",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "Not collected"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "description": "Resources Puppet found changed away from policy and put back, over the last seven days. This is the enforcement signal: a scanner tells you the state at one moment, this tells you policy was reasserted. Read beside intentional change below.",
      "id": 1616017926
    },
